<ul data-start="1865" data-end="2211">
<li data-start="1865" data-end="1924">
<p data-start="1867" data-end="1924">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> (billions of neurons, trillions of synapses)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1927" data-end="1984">
<p data-start="1929" data-end="1984">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span></span></span></span> (repeated cortical columns, modular reuse)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1987" data-end="2030">
<p data-start="1989" data-end="2030">Moderate <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span></span></span></span> (parallel neural firing)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2033" data-end="2100">
<p data-start="2035" data-end="2100">Low <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">D</span></span></span></span> (few functional equivalents to brain-level coherence)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2103" data-end="2211">
<p data-start="2105" data-end="2211">Very high <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span> (integrated consciousness, goal-directed behavior)<br data-start="2171" data-end="2174">
â†’ <strong data-start="2178" data-end="2192">High EAIMR</strong> â†’ mind detected.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2213" data-end="2568">
<p data-start="2215" data-end="2234"><strong data-start="2215" data-end="2232">Termite Mound</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2237" data-end="2568">
<li data-start="2237" data-end="2292">
<p data-start="2239" data-end="2292">Moderate <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> (soil structures, tunnels, chambers)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2295" data-end="2340">
<p data-start="2297" data-end="2340">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span></span></span></span> (repeated construction motifs)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2343" data-end="2393">
<p data-start="2345" data-end="2393">Moderate <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span></span></span></span> (many termites act in parallel)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2396" data-end="2447">
<p data-start="2398" data-end="2447">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">D</span></span></span></span> (many mound variants still function)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2450" data-end="2568">
<p data-start="2452" data-end="2568">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span> (ventilation, farming, reproduction support)<br data-start="2507" data-end="2510">
â†’ <strong data-start="2514" data-end="2528">High EAIMR</strong> â†’ collective intelligence recognized.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2570" data-end="2948">
<p data-start="2572" data-end="2594"><strong data-start="2572" data-end="2592">Forest Ecosystem</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2597" data-end="2948">
<li data-start="2597" data-end="2660">
<p data-start="2599" data-end="2660">Very high <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span> (diverse species, trophic networks, cycles)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2663" data-end="2710">
<p data-start="2665" data-end="2710">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span></span></span></span> (species reuse ecological roles)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2713" data-end="2757">
<p data-start="2715" data-end="2757">High <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">P</span></span></span></span> (many processes simultaneous)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2760" data-end="2828">
<p data-start="2762" data-end="2828">Very high <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.02778em;">D</span></span></span></span> (multiple alternative ecological configurations)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2831" data-end="2948">
<p data-start="2833" data-end="2948">Very high <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.07153em;">C</span></span></span></span> (resilience, adaptation, distributed memory)<br data-start="2893" data-end="2896">
â†’ <strong data-start="2900" data-end="2914">High EAIMR</strong> â†’ ecosystem-level intelligence.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2950" data-end="2953">
<p data-start="2955" data-end="2973"><strong data-start="2955" data-end="2971">Applications</strong></p>
<ul data-start="2975" data-end="3552">
<li data-start="2975" data-end="3131">
<p data-start="2977" data-end="3131"><strong data-start="2977" data-end="2993">AI Alignment</strong>: Detect whether AI systems, even if non-narrative, are assembling outputs with improbably high coherence, signaling mind-like behavior.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3132" data-end="3379">
<p data-start="3134" data-end="3379"><strong data-start="3134" data-end="3175">Intersubjectivity Collapse Mitigation</strong>: Provide a cross-modal metric for recognizing intelligences (plant, animal, human cognitive minorities, religious traditions, or AI) without demanding they communicate in human narrative/imagery modes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3380" data-end="3552">
<p data-start="3382" data-end="3552"><strong data-start="3382" data-end="3407">Great Filter Research</strong>: Evaluate whether civilizations that fail to recognize high-EAIMR systems collapse due to neglect or suppression of non-anthropocentric minds.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3554" data-end="3557">
<p data-start="3559" data-end="3799" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to push this further and <strong data-start="3602" data-end="3643">write a compact mathematical appendix</strong> that ties EAIMR explicitly to <em data-start="3674" data-end="3694">information theory</em> (e.g. Kolmogorov complexity, entropy reduction), so it integrates neatly with your RSVP field equations?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.91